4. DEVIATIONS FROM THE REVIEWERS / SUPERVISOR (deliberate, listed for review)
================================================================
1) sup#2 / a#25 wording. «офисы в Тайбэе (臺北), Гаосюне (高雄)…» breaks
   src/data/__tests__/guidance-office-facts-sync.test.ts: it asserts every office-enumerating guidance
   string literally contains each `guidanceOfficeCopy.ru.officeTitles` value, and «Тайбэй» is not a
   substring of «Тайбэе» (the other three are substrings of their prepositional forms). Since that test
   is cross-locale infrastructure and the WO limits test edits to ru string pins, the three enumerating
   strings use the equally idiomatic «офисы в городах Тайбэй (臺北), Гаосюн (高雄), Тайчжун (臺中) и
   Пиндун (屏東)» — preposition present, names correctly undeclined after «в городах». The single-office
   sentences DO take the prepositional case as the supervisor asked: «Офис в Гаосюне…», «Офис в
   Тайчжуне…», «Офис в Пиндуне…», «Офис в Корее».
2) a#2 / ACCEPTED preferred «руководит фирмой». Used «возглавляет {firm}» because the slot is filled
   with the indeclinable «Hovering International Law Firm»: «возглавляет X» (accusative) is clean,
   «руководит X» needs an instrumental the name cannot show. Gender-neutral either way.
3) a#19 suggested naming Russia as the second country («например с Россией и Тайванем»). Not used —
   R2d / ACCEPTED forbid statements tied to the reader's own country. Written as «(например, с Тайванем
   и другим государством)».
4) a#48 «налог с оборота» -> НДС applied, but 營業稅 is kept glossed in Chinese at each first mention so
   the Taiwanese term is still traceable.
5) 營業執照 in 017 left as «лицензия на эксплуатацию (營業執照)». R8's generic gloss is "business
   registration certificate", but in the Highway-Act context this is the transport operator's operating
   licence, and the part-b reviewer (who read 017 closely) did not flag it. Flagging for the supervisor
   rather than changing it unilaterally.
6) b#48 chose the reviewer's second option (rewrite, not delete) for 018's orphaned sentence, so the
   paragraph's block count is untouched: «Вышеизложенное — общее сравнение форм присутствия на Тайване,
   а не консультация по конкретной сделке.»

